{"title": "[花邊] 旗子:嚮往Dirk一人一城 但不一定我能決定", "author": "Wojnarowski (@wojespn)", "board": "", "date": "Sun Nov  1 14:22:43 2026", "url": "https://www.ptt.cc/bbs/NBA/M.1793514167.A.E81.html", "body": "Cooper Flagg says he wants to spend his whole career in Dallas and be loved li\nke Dirk, but staying isn’t entirely up to him\n\nQ: \"Would you like to be on one team? Forever?\"\n\nCooper Flagg: \"100%. I think I would like nothing more than that to be able to\n... you look at someone like Dirk, obviously, his legacy, there’s nothing tha\nt touches that, to be that loved by a city, to have that much love and support\n from one place. I don’t think you could dream for anything else but that.\"\n\n\"That’s the ultimate goal, but like we were just talking about, it’s a busin\ness at the end of the day and a lot of it’s not going to be my decision.\"\n\nhttps://x.com/katsuxbt/status/2116668443751584223\n\nCooper Flagg表示，他希望自己的整個職業生涯都留在達拉斯，像Dirk一樣受到球迷的愛\n戴，但能否留下來並不完全取決於他自己。\n\nQ：你希望自己一輩子都效力同一支球隊嗎？\n\nFlagg：\n\n百分之百。我想不到還有什麼比這更令人嚮往的了。你看看Dirk，他所留下的傳奇，顯然\n是無可比擬的。能夠像他一樣受到一座城市的喜愛，獲得來自同一個地方如此多的支持與\n愛戴，我認為這已經是夢寐以求的一切了。\n\n那就是我最終的目標。但就像我們剛才談到的，說到底，這終究是一門生意，而很多事情\n並不是由我自己決定的。\n\nCooper Flagg says injuries pushed him into a bigger role than expected as a ro\nokie, but Jason Kidd gave him the confidence to grow as a playmaker\n\n“Coming in I wasn’t expecting to be thrown in the fire as much. Obviously I\nwas looking at AD, Kai, Klay, and some of the injuries it just didn’t work ou\nt that way and kind of just thrown out there more than I expected and had a li\nttle bit more responsibility, but overall it’s just helped me to develop.”\n\n“Coach Kidd has given me that confidence to go out and be a creator and learn\n the game in a lot of different ways, it’s helped me to just get comfortable\nall around.”\n\nhttps://x.com/katsuxbt/status/2116605719290278035\n\n旗子在另一個Podcast則談到他的新秀賽季\n\n旗子表示，傷兵問題讓他在新秀賽季比預期更早承擔起更重要的角色，而總教練Jason Ki\ndd則給予他信心，讓他逐漸成長為一名更出色的組織者。\n\nFlagg：\n\n剛加入球隊時，我沒想到自己會這麼早就被推上第一線。當時我顯然是以為球隊有AD、KI\n和Klay這些球員，但後來因為一些傷病，情況並沒有按照原本的計畫發展。我因此比預期\n更早獲得上場機會，也承擔了更多責任，但整體而言，這些經歷都幫助我成長。\n\nKidd教練給了我足夠的信心，讓我能夠放手去創造進攻機會，並從不同角度學習比賽。這\n也幫助我逐漸適應各種場上角色，變得更加自在。\n\n短評或心得：\n\n新秀賽季Kidd讓旗子有一段時間打控衛", "comments": [{"tag": "噓", "user": "cor1os", "content": "Nico笑而不語", "time": "11/01 14:23"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "cor1os", "content": "記得不要吃太胖啊", "time": "11/01 14:23"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "Aggro", "content": "會怕就好", "time": "11/01 14:23"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "yniori", "content": "不要吃太胖，不然會被賣掉", "time": "11/01 14:24"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "cominlin", "content": "旗子是美國白人 應該蠻吸金的 捨不得賣掉吧", "time": "11/01 14:25"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "axi", "content": "別喝紅茶 別吃太胖", "time": "11/01 14:25"}, {"tag": "噓", "user": "Hugo92466312", "content": "還真是 在這地方到時候就被白痴管理層交易了", "time": "11/01 14:26"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "axi", "content": "顏色正確 只要不發福變胖 體能別下降 應該可以", "time": "11/01 14:26"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "Hugo92466312", "content": "77當時候也沒人覺得他會被交易喔XD", "time": "11/01 14:26"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "conqueror507", "content": "這張約跑完前沒有奪冠，你就很危險了", "time": "11/01 14:26"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "c87873334", "content": "還有回波士頓", "time": "11/01 14:27"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "c87873334", "content": "歡迎", "time": "11/01 14:28"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "kterry01", "content": "再來個Nico就神奇了", "time": "11/01 14:28"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "conqueror507", "content": "前一年進總冠軍戰，隔年就被賤賣了", "time": "11/01 14:28"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "lillardfor3", "content": "等著單換PG", "time": "11/01 14:29"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "vgil", "content": "Nico滾了  應該不會被賣吧….應該吧….", "time": "11/01 14:30"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "wwf1588", "content": "你的前輩被掃地出門", "time": "11/01 14:33"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "kitty93206", "content": "吃太胖會被賣掉", "time": "11/01 14:34"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "Gilbertsky", "content": "剛打進總冠的核心也可能被賣 沒有誰是安全的", "time": "11/01 14:34"}, {"tag": "推", "user": "nsbgm", "content": "Kidd那段經歷讓他也變得更強 其實", "time": "11/01 14:35"}, {"tag": "→", "user": "brian040818", "content": "77 JB 沒有誰是不會被賣的 除非像咖哩這種好幾冠", "time": 